{"source": "kew-african", "source_id": "96874", "taxon": "Stylochiton salaamicus N.E. Br.", "organ": "description", "language": "en", "text": "Rhizome ± horizontal, 0.5–1.2 cm. thick. Cataphylls up to 8 cm. long, acute to subacute, purplish green, finely speckled with purple. Leaves several; petiole 10–60 cm. long, green, paler basally with dark green to purple speckles vaguely associated into irregular barring pattern; basal sheath 3–18 cm. long, gradually narrowing to apex; blade broadly triangular in outline, hastate-sagittate, 6–30 cm. long, 6–28 cm. broad, often as broad or broader than long, glabrous or sometimes sparsely pubescent on lower surface, dark ± glossy green on upper surface, paler beneath, apex acute to obtuse, very shortly (to 3 mm.) apiculate, sinus separating basal lobes usually broad. Inflorescence appearing with or without the leaves, subtended by several cataphylls, borne at ground-level. Peduncle short, 1–4 cm. long or less. Spathe 6–23 cm. long, glabrous, pale green, veins somewhat ribbed on outer surface; basal tube erect, 2–8.5 cm. long, upper part cylindric, 0.5–1.8 cm. in diameter, lower part inflated, broadly ovoid, 1.5–3.5 cm. long, 1–2.7 cm. in diameter; apical limb usually about half total spathe length, erect, lanceolate- to ovate-elliptic with ± revolute margins, 3–14 cm. long, 1–4 cm. broad, inner surface somewhat thickened, smooth, green tinged yellow, apex with short conical apiculum. Spadix shorter than spathe-tube, hidden or with only extreme tip exposed, 2.5–7.5 cm. long; staminate part cylindric, 2.5–4 cm. long, 0.5–0.7 cm. thick, contiguous with pistillate part or separated from it by naked interstice up to 0.5 cm. long; pistillate part hemispherical, subglobose or globose, 0.8–1.5 cm. long, 1.1–1.6 cm. broad. Staminate flowers with 4–7 stamens; perigons ± congested, pale greenish cream, rhomboid, margins massively thickened, conspicuously rugose; filaments slender, filiform; central pistillode ± conoid, longitudinally rugose, 1–3-cleft apically, normally projecting somewhat above perigon-margins. Pistillate flowers 9–18, spirally arranged; perigon regular, 5–6-sided, massively thickened, pale buff and mealy on upper surface; ovary subglobose, rugose on upper surface, 2-locular; ovules 2–3 per locule; placentae axile, situated centrally near apex of septum; style subcylindric, green, up to 3 mm. long; stigmas capitate, often oblique, up to 2 mm. broad. Berries obpolyhedral, 1 cm. long, 1.3 cm. broad, exposed surface convex, papillate-rugose, 1–2-seeded, borne in globose infructescence 1.5–2.5 cm. in diameter. Seed elliptic, 6–7 mm. long, 3–4 mm. broad.", "assertions": [{"po_id": "PO_0004542", "pato_id": "PATO_0001855", "po_label": "rhizome", "pato_label": "horizontal", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "usually", "source_text": "Rhizome ± horizontal"}, {"po_id": "PO_0004542", "pato_id": "PATO_0000915", "po_label": "rhizome", "pato_label": "thickness", "negated": false, "value_low": 0.5, "value_high": 1.2, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "0.5–1.2 cm. thick"}, {"po_id": "PO_0006003", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "scale leaf", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": 8.0, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "Cataphylls up to 8 cm. long"}, {"po_id": "PO_0006003", "pato_id": "PATO_0000389", "po_label": "scale leaf", "pato_label": "acute", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "acute to subacute"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020038", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "petiole", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": 10.0, "value_high": 60.0, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "petiole 10–60 cm. long"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020038", "pato_id": "PATO_0000320", "po_label": "petiole", "pato_label": "green", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "green"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020039", "pato_id": "PATO_0001875", "po_label": "leaf lamina", "pato_label": "triangular", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "blade broadly triangular in outline"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020039", "pato_id": "PATO_0001881", "po_label": "leaf lamina", "pato_label": "arrow-shaped", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "hastate-sagittate"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020039", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "leaf lamina", "pato_label": "length", "negated": false, "value_low": 6.0, "value_high": 30.0, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "6–30 cm. long"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020039", "pato_id": "PATO_0000921", "po_label": "leaf lamina", "pato_label": "width", "negated": false, "value_low": 6.0, "value_high": 28.0, "unit": "cm", "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "6–28 cm. broad"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020039", "pato_id": "PATO_0000453", "po_label": "leaf lamina", "pato_label": "glabrous", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "usually", "source_text": "glabrous or sometimes sparsely pubescent on lower surface"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020039", "pato_id": "PATO_0001249", "po_label": "leaf lamina", "pato_label": "dark green", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "dark ± glossy green on upper surface"}, {"po_id": "PO_0020137", "pato_id": "PATO_0000389", "po_label": "leaf apex", "pato_label": "acute", "negated": false, "value_low": null, "value_high": null, "unit": null, "value_text": "", "modifier": "", "source_text": "apex acute to obtuse"}, {"po_id": "PO_0009053", "pato_id": "PATO_0000122", "po_label": "peduncle", "pato_